INSERT INTO questions (id, lesson_id, license, category, theme, subtopic, difficulty, level, question_fr, question_en, options, options_en, answer_key, explanation_fr, explanation_en, tags) VALUES
('6ae9c0a4-0000-4000-8000-00006ae9c0a4', '16adb2b8-0000-4000-8000-000016adb2b8', 'PPL', 'instrumentation', 'instrumentation', 'Comprendre un blocage statique', 2, 2, 'Vrai ou faux ? Une table de pannes simple décrit exactement toutes les fuites et obstructions partielles.', 'True or false? A simple failure table exactly describes every leak and partial blockage.', '["Vrai", "Faux"]', '["True", "False"]', 'Faux', 'Cette affirmation est fausse.

Dans le modèle classique d''une source statique totalement bloquée, la pression reste enfermée. L''altimètre conserve approximativement l''indication du moment du blocage et le variomètre revient vers zéro après son transitoire. L''anémomètre est lui aussi affecté, car il compare pression totale et statique. Ces symptômes ne couvrent pas les obstructions partielles, fuites ou architectures particulières : apprendre un tableau de panne ne permet pas de diagnostiquer avec certitude chaque installation.

![Une source statique bloquée affecte plusieurs instruments : altimètre approximativement figé, variomètre revenant à zéro et anémomètre perturbé.](/illustrations/ppl-ins-002.svg)', 'This statement is false.

In the classic model of a completely blocked static source, pressure is trapped. The altimeter approximately retains its indication at blockage, and the vertical speed indicator returns towards zero after its transient response. The airspeed indicator is also affected because it compares total and static pressure. These symptoms do not cover partial blockages, leaks or specific architectures: memorising a failure table cannot diagnose every installation with certainty.

![Diagram: Cross-checking instruments and unreliable indications](/illustrations/en/ppl-ins-002.svg)', '["PPL", "quiz-15-extension", "true-false"]')
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, license = EXCLUDED.license, category = EXCLUDED.category, theme = EXCLUDED.theme, subtopic = EXCLUDED.subtopic, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, level = EXCLUDED.level, question_fr = EXCLUDED.question_fr, question_en = EXCLUDED.question_en, options = EXCLUDED.options, options_en = EXCLUDED.options_en, answer_key = EXCLUDED.answer_key, explanation_fr = EXCLUDED.explanation_fr, explanation_en = EXCLUDED.explanation_en, tags = EXCLUDED.tags;

