![Préparer le dossier du vol, contrôler l’avion puis vérifier la cabine et le briefing des occupants.](/illustrations/ppl-op-001.svg)', 'Flight preparation and aircraft inspection complement each other.

![Diagram: Pre-Flight Procedures](/illustrations/en/ppl-op-001.svg)', '["preflight", "walkaround", "checklist", "inspection", "exam-mcq", "exam-subject:operational_procedures"]')
